#. paragraph
#: site/lectures/07-text-and-regex.md:1497
msgid "`07-text-and-regex/homework.py` (in the homework repository): **clean the client register** - a function for each column of `client_register.csv`, then the whole file as a list of clean records, with a summary: how many values were fixed and how many could not be fixed, per column. The last part takes the payments out of the comments with a regular expression. Every check must print `OK`."
